# Raspberry Pi Touch Display 2 (10"): taps land ~1.2% (14 px) below the finger.
# Fit from 5 on-screen targets, 2026-09-06. Screen y maps to device x inverted
# (output transform 270), so the correction lives in the matrix' first row.
# See ~/touchcal/ for the harness that produced it.
ACTION=="add|change", KERNEL=="event*", ATTRS{name}=="11-0041 ili_v3", \
  ENV{LIBINPUT_CALIBRATION_MATRIX}="1.018265 0 0.003087 0 1 0"
